h=\"118\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 117.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 27.7 27.7 34.4 34.4 42.0 42.0 48.7 48.7 56.3 72.0 85.4 85.4 93.0\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"93.0 101.3\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> kezalik kim olursa olsun kendilerine karabet sahibi bulunan akrıbaya,</p><p>4-<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"94\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 93.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 27.7 27.7 34.4 41.3 48.0 54.7 54.7 62.3 69.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"41.3 48.0 69.0 77.3\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> babaları ölmüş, yetim kalmış çocuklara,</p><p>5-<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"112\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 111.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 27.0 33.7 33.7 45.0 63.7 72.7 72.7 80.3 87.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"51.7 51.7 63.7 87.0 95.3\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> maişetlerini kazanamıyarak, ellerinde avuçlarında bir geçim vasıtası bulunmayan miskinlere dahi ihsan edeceksiniz. </p><p>6-<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"177\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 176.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 23.3 23.3 30.0 42.0 42.0 63.0 78.0 84.7 84.7 91.4 98.3 98.3 114.7 121.4 129.7 129.7 137.3 145.4 145.4 152.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"30.0 63.0 84.7 152.3 160.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> sair insanlara da güzel söz söyleyiniz.</p><p>7-<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"145\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 144.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 23.3 31.4 31.4 38.3 38.3 52.4 60.0 75.7 82.4 90.7 90.7 99.7 106.4 106.4 113.3 120.0\" y=\"25.4 25.4 2